sequenceDiagram
    actor Admin as IT Admin
    participant Sched as Scheduler (node-cron, in-process)
    participant FE as Frontend (React)
    participant BE as Backend (Express)
    participant DB as Database (Aiven MySQL via Prisma)
    participant CS as Cloud Storage (Backblaze B2)

    Note over Sched,CS: Scheduled run -- no user action needed
    Sched->>BE: Trigger runBackup() on configured schedule
    BE->>DB: mysqldump({connection: host, port, user, password, database})
    DB-->>BE: {schema, trigger, data}
    BE->>BE: Concatenate schema + trigger + data into one SQL file
    alt BACKUP_ENCRYPTION_KEY is set
        BE->>BE: AES-256-GCM encrypt (random IV + auth tag prepended), filename gets .sql.enc
    else no key configured
        BE->>BE: Keep plaintext .sql
    end
    BE->>BE: Write file to local disk with 0600 permissions (owner read/write only)
    alt Cloud Storage configured
        BE->>CS: Upload backup file under backups/ prefix
        BE->>CS: List existing backups, delete any older than 14 days
    end
    BE->>BE: Delete local backups older than retention window
    BE->>DB: writeAuditLog(BACKUP_COMPLETED) or (BACKUP_FAILED) on error

    Note over Admin,CS: Manual run -- password-gated
    Admin->>FE: Click "Run Backup Now"
    FE->>Admin: Show PasswordConfirmModal
    Admin->>FE: Enter own account password
    FE->>BE: POST /api/auth/verify-password {password}
    BE-->>FE: 200 verified, or 401
    FE->>BE: POST /api/system/backup/run
    BE->>BE: Same runBackup() flow as scheduled run above
    BE-->>FE: 200 accepted (no success text shown -- history list refreshes instead)

    Note over Admin,CS: Viewing backup history
    Admin->>FE: Open System Monitoring page
    FE->>BE: GET /api/system/backups
    alt Cloud Storage configured
        BE->>CS: ListObjectsV2 under backups/ prefix
    else
        BE->>BE: Read local backups directory
    end
    BE-->>FE: List of {filename, size, timestamp}
